|---------|--------------|------------|
| **Safari** | Slow, unstable element location | Use explicit waits, retries |
| **Safari** | No native touch actions | Use JavaScript events |
| **Chrome** | ChromeDriver version mismatch | Specify exact version |
| **Firefox** | GeckoDriver quirks | Add capability `moz:firefoxOptions` |
| **Samsung Internet** | Limited WebDriver support | Use Chrome capabilities |

