| Browser | Driver | Setup |
|---------|--------|-------|
| **Chrome** | ChromeDriver | Download matching version |
| **Firefox** | GeckoDriver | Automatic via WebDriverManager |
| **Edge** | EdgeDriver | Built-in or download |
| **Safari** | SafariDriver | Built-in (macOS only) |

**2. Multiple Locator Strategies**

```java
