WebElement username = form.findElement(By.id("username"));
```

**8. Advanced Element Location**

```java
// Relative locators (Selenium 4)
WebElement password = driver.findElement(By.id("password"));

// Find element near another
WebElement loginButton = driver.findElement(
    RelativeLocator.with(By.tagName("button"))
        .below(password)
);

// Find elements left/right/above/below/near
List<WebElement> elements = driver.findElements(
    RelativeLocator.with(By.className("field"))
        .above(By.id("submit"))
);
```

