**1. Wait Strategy Decision Tree**

```
Is the element always present?
├── Yes → Use implicit wait (safety net)
└── No → Is the timing predictable?
    ├── Yes → Use explicit wait with timeout
    └── No → Use fluent wait with polling
        ↓
        Is the condition complex?
        ├── Yes → Create custom ExpectedCondition
