**5. Smart Wait Configuration**

```java
public class SmartWaitConfiguration {
    private final WebDriver driver;
    private final int defaultTimeout;
    private final int pollingInterval;

    public SmartWaitConfiguration(WebDriver driver) {
        this.driver = driver;
        this.defaultTimeout = 10;
        this.pollingInterval = 500;
    }

    // Element-specific timeouts
    public WebElement waitForElement(By locator, WaitPriority priority) {
        int timeout = priority.getTimeout();

        WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(timeout));
        wait.pollingEvery(Duration.ofMillis(pollingInterval));

        return wait.until(ExpectedConditions.visibilityOfElementLocated(locator));
    }

    public enum WaitPriority {
        CRITICAL(20),    // Critical elements (20 seconds)
        NORMAL(10),      // Normal elements (10 seconds)
        MINOR(5),        // Minor elements (5 seconds)
        BACKGROUND(2);   // Background elements (2 seconds)

        private final int timeout;
        WaitPriority(int timeout) { this.timeout = timeout; }
        public int getTimeout() { return timeout; }
    }

    // Conditional waits based on element type
    public WebElement waitForButton(By locator) {
        return new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10))
            .until(ExpectedConditions.elementToBeClickable(locator));
    }

    public WebElement waitForInput(By locator) {
        return new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10))
            .until(ExpectedConditions.presenceOfElementLocated(locator));
    }

    public WebElement waitForText(By locator) {
        return new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10))
            .until(ExpectedConditions.visibilityOfElementLocated(locator));
    }
}
```

**6. Anti-Patterns and Solutions**

| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Solution |
|--------------|---------|----------|
| **Thread.sleep()** | Wastes time, brittle | Use explicit waits |
| **Implicit waits only** | Limited, can't customize | Combine with explicit |
| **Too short timeout** | Flaky tests | Increase appropriately |
| **Too long timeout** | Slow tests | Optimize waits |
| **No polling interval** | Resource waste | Add polling interval |
| **Ignoring exceptions** | Hidden failures | Handle exceptions properly |

