**7. Common Pitfalls and Solutions**

| Pitfall | Symptom | Solution |
|---------|---------|----------|
| **File not found** | Test fails to start | Use absolute paths or check working directory |
| **Encoding issues** | Special characters corrupted | Always use UTF-8 encoding |
| **Data exhaustion** | Threads stop unexpectedly | Set Recycle on EOF=True for long tests |
| **Wrong sharing mode** | Users share same data | Use Current thread for per-user data sets |
| **Header misinterpreted** | First row used as data | Check "Ignore first line?" |
| **Delimiter mismatch** | Variables not split | Verify delimiter matches file |
| **Path issues in CI/CD** | Tests fail in pipeline | Use __P to pass file paths from command line |

