**Fine-Grained Test Selection**

Tags allow you to categorize tests and include or exclude them in suites.

**Tagging Test Methods:**

```java
import org.junit.jupiter.api.Tag;
import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;

class TaggedTestClass {

    @Test
    @Tag("smoke")
    @Tag("critical")
    void smokeTest() { }

    @Test
    @Tag("regression")
    void regressionTest() { }

    @Test
    @Tag("slow")
    @Tag("performance")
    void performanceTest() { }

    @Test
    @Tag("database")
    @Tag("integration")
    void databaseTest() { }
}
```

**Tagging Test Classes:**

```java
@Tag("unit")
class UnitTestClass {
    @Test void test1() { }
    @Test void test2() { }
}

@Tag("integration")
